invariant: INV-22
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: ch_tls.psk_selected is set whenever the hello offered a ticket,
  a declined one included. The drivers read it to decide whether a
  Certificate comes next, so the client skips the certificate step and
  refuses the server's Certificate, and a caller would read a full
  handshake as a resumed one. The declined-ticket rows and the handler
  row object.

--- old
    h->t->psk_selected = (uint8_t)(psk_offered && info->psk_ok);
--- new
    h->t->psk_selected = (uint8_t)psk_offered;
